# Bringup-pipeline run artifacts must not be versioned. Keep code, READMEs,
# work logs, and the compact summary/config JSONs that code, tests, or stage
# gates actually read; raw dumps stay on the runner (or in the job's evidence
# store), not in the repo. Override with `git add -f` only for a file a
# committed check or runtime path genuinely loads.
*.csv
*.gz
*.log
*.refpt
*.tensorbin
*.pt
*.png
*/doc/*/logs/
*/doc/*/tracy/
*/doc/*/watcher/
*/doc/*/triage/
*/doc/*/runs/
*/doc/*/runs_*/
